      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "SHE'S PEAKIN' (1) ran a good time (41.52) when second a Grade 5/6 at this track after jumping from this box. Worth following up. MONDO CORTEZ (2) scored well last start as odds-on favourite by 7 lengths at this track in a handy 29.90 beating Wiggle On. Has a low draw and goes well at this distance. Can measure up again. ARTHUR TANGO (4) turned spotting a big start finishing fifth (41.74) last time in a Grade 5/6 at this track. Yet to win out of this box but has been in the placings two times from three starts. A forward showing wouldn't surprise. TRUMPET TEARS (8) should be thereabouts despite an unplaced run here most recently.",
